# The cross-file half of #1621. Every multi-axis subscript lives in grid.spy, a non-entry
# file — the MultiAxisAccessLowering facts are recorded while checking grid.spy and must
# survive SemanticInfo.MergeFrom into the project-wide merge that code generation reads.
# Without the stanza in MergeFrom the facts are dropped and the emitter's absent-fact throw
# fires (descriptive ICE) instead of emitting the indexer / Slice call.
# Values verified against python3 + numpy 2.5.1 (see grid.spy).
